        "fields": {
          "notes": "Scholarly Work reported as ATU 3 / ADFU 13, Berlin: Gebr. Mann, 1993. Official and library records report Robert K. Englund and Hans J. Nissen as authors and Peter Damerow as collaborator; CDLI places all three in its author list. LLATU denotes the book’s sign-index coordinate system at pp. 177–327."
